<p>
    If you run a business in India and are registered under GST, issuing a
    <strong>GST-compliant tax invoice</strong> is mandatory. This guide explains the correct
    <strong>GST invoice format in India</strong>, including required fields, tax calculation examples, and downloadable templates.
